<!--T:63-->
{{TitleProperty|Start}}

<!--T:64-->
* {{PropertyData|Start Type|Enumeration}}: sets how the revolution start is defined (Profile plane, Offset, Reference), see [[#Options|Options]]. {{Version|26.3}}
* {{PropertyData|Start Offset|Angle}}: angular offset between the profile and the start of the revolution. Not used if {{PropertyData|Start Type}} is '''Profile plane'''. {{Version|26.3}}
* {{PropertyData|Start Reference|LinkSub}}: a face, plane, or sketch the revolution starts from. Only used if {{PropertyData|Start Type}} is '''Reference'''. {{Version|26.3}}


